          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትም ፤ ኢሳ ፡ ፶፫ ፡ ፱ ። ፩ ፡ ጴጥ ፡ ፪ ፡ ፳፪ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": "፮",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፮ ፤ ወኵሉ ፡ ዘቦቱ ፡ ይነብር ፡ ኢይኤብስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በእሱም ፡ አምኖ ፡ ጸንቶ ፡ የሚኖር ፡ አይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በድልም ። ሐተታ ፡ አንድ ፡ ጊዜ ፡ ቢበ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድል ፡ ሁለተኛ ፡ በሥጋ ፡ ቢበድል ፡ በ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነፍስ ፡ በሐልዮ ፡ ቢበድል ፡ በነቢብ ፡ በ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገቢር ፡ አይበድልም ፡ በንስሐ ፡ በፍጹም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተገብቶ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ ኵሉ ፡ ዘይኤብስ ፡ ኢይሬእዮ ፡ ወኢየአምሮ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የሚበድል ፡ ሰው ፡ ሁሉ ፡ እግዚአብሔ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርን፡ አያየውም፡አያውቀውምና።አንድም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አያምነውም፡ አይወደውምና፡ሮሜ፡፯፡፲፬።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": "፯",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፯ ፤ ደቂቅየ ፡ ኢያስሕቱክሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልጆቼ ፡ ጥቃቅኑ ፡ ኃጢአት ፡ ከደጋጉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኃጢአት ፡ አያደርስም ፤ ጥቃቅኑ ፡ ከደ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጋጉ ፡ ኃጢአት ፡ ጋራ ፡ ከመንግሥተ ፡ ሰ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማይ ፡ በማውጣት ፡ አንድ ፡ አይደለም ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንድም ፡ ኃጢአት ፡ ክህደት ፡ አይደለ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትም ፡ የሚሉ ፡ ሰዎች ፡ አያስቷችሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ኵሉ ፡ ዘይገብራ ፡ ለጽድቅ ፡ ጻድቅ ፡ ውእቱ ፡ በከመ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዝክቱ ፡ ጻድቅ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጽድቅን ፡ የሚሠራ ፡ ሰው ፡ ሁሉ ፡ እሱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጻድቅ ፡ እንደ ፡ ሆነ ፡ ዕውነተኛ ፡ ነው። ም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፪ ፡ ፳፱ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": "፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፰ ፤ ወዘሰ ፡ ይገብራ ፡ ለኃጢአት ፡ እምነ ፡ ጋኔን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውእቱ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኃጢአትን ፡ የሚሠራ ፡ ግን ፡ ከጋኔን ፡ የተ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማረ ፡ ከጋኔን ፡ የተወለደ ፡ ነው ። ጋኔን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ማለት ፡ ዕሩቅ ፡ ውዱቅ ፡ ማለት ፡ ነው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ ቀዳሚሁ ፡ ሰይጣን ፡ አበሰ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አስቀድሞ ፡ የበደለ ፡ ሰይጣን ፡ ነውና ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰይጣን ፡ ማለት ፡ መስተቃርን ፡ መስተ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጻርር ፡ ባላጋራ ፡ ማለት ፡ ነው ፡ (ጥቅ) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወአቀመ ፡ አዴርሃ ፡ ሰይጣነ ፡ ላዕለ ፡ ሰሎ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሞን ፡ እንዲል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወበእንተ ፡ ዝንቱ ፡ አስተርአየ ፡ ወልደ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስለዚህ ፡ የእግዚአብሔር ፡ የባሕርይ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልጅ ፡ በሥጋ ፡ ተገለጸ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ከመ ፡ ይስዐር ፡ ግብሮ ፡ ለጋኔን ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የጋኔን፡ግብሩን፡ያጠፋ፡ዘንድ፡ዮሐ፡፰፡፵፬።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": "፱",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፱ ፤ ወኵሉ ፡ ዘይትወለድ ፡ እምእግዚአብሔር ፡ ኢ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይገብራ ፡ ለኃጢአት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከእግዚአብሔር ፡ የተወለደ ። አንድም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የተማረ ፡ ግን ፡ ኃጢአትን ፡ አይሠራትም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ ዘርዐ ፡ ዚአሁ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የእግዚአብሔር ፡ ልጅ ፡ ነውና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወቦቱ ፡ ይነብር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሱ ፡ አምኖ ፡ ጸንቶ ፡ ይኖራልና ። አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድም ፡ ዘርዐ ፡ ዚአሁ ፡ ምእመን ፡ ቦቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይነብር ፡ በሱ ፡ አምኖ ፡ ጸንቶ ፡ ይኖራ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልና ። አንድም ፡ ዘርዐ ፡ ዚአሁ ፡ ወንጌል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በምእመን ፡ ጸንቶ ፡ ይኖራልና ፡ (ጥቅ) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘርዕሰ ፡ ቃለ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡ ውእቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዲል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወኢይክል ፡ አብሶ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መበደል፡አይቻለውም፡ አለ፡አይበድልም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ እምእግዚአብሔር ፡ ተወልደ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከእግዚአብሔር ፡ ተወልዷል ፡ ከእግዚአ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሔር ፡ ተምሯልና ፡ ቍ ፡ ፱ ፡ ም ፡ ፭፡፲፰ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": "፲",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፲ ፤ ወበዝንቱ ፡ እሙራን ፡ ውእቶሙ ፡ ደቂቀ ፡ እግ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዚአብሔር ፡ ወደቂቀ ፡ ጋኔን ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዚህም ፡ ደቂቀ ፡ እግዚአብሔርና፡ደቂቀ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጋኔን ፡ የተለዩ ፡ ናቸው፡ አለ፡ ይታወቃሉ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ኵሉ፡ዘኢይገብራ፡ለጽድቅ፡ኢኮነ፡እምእግዚአብሔር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
